in the first place.

00:17:40.967 --> 00:17:42.858
That's why we've come
to bail you out.

00:17:43.127 --> 00:17:45.236
Bail me out? Seriously?

00:17:46.673 --> 00:17:50.240
Uh, look, I'm sorry
I overreacted, you guys.

00:17:50.477 --> 00:17:51.809
I think I was just frustrated

00:17:51.811 --> 00:17:53.569
