winning anything.

00:17:53.807 --> 00:17:55.450
Peter, of course
you're a winner.

00:17:55.475 --> 00:17:57.982
You've got a beautiful wife,
a family who loves you,

00:17:57.984 --> 00:17:59.500
and-and a bathroom window

00:17:59.577 --> 00:18:01.169
that's not as frosted
as you think.

00:18:01.245 --> 00:18:03.370
And you're white.
That's a big one.

00:18:03.448 --> 00:18:04.021
Oh, yeah.

00:18:04.138 --> 00:18:06.081
My insulated experience
of the world

00:18:06.159 --> 00:18:07.416
always makes me forget that.

00:18:07.436 --> 00:18:09.251
We pooled our last 15 dollars

00:18:09.329 --> 00:18:11.104
