to pay your fine.

00:18:11.181 --> 00:18:12.939
-50 dollars?
-No, 15.

00:18:14.017 --> 00:18:15.349
See? This, that-that's,

00:18:15.426 --> 00:18:17.485
this is the thing
that I was saying.

00:18:24.462 --> 00:18:26.010
Man, you guys are the best.

00:18:26.113 --> 00:18:28.513
I hope you can forgive me
for acting so crazy.

00:18:28.515 --> 00:18:29.864
Of course we do, Peter.

00:18:30.446 --> 00:18:31.982
Wait a second.
You got me out of jail

00:18:32.018 --> 00:18:34.686
