after I committed a robbery?

00:18:34.854 --> 00:18:37.688
Well, I, uh,
pulled a few strings.

00:18:37.765 --> 00:18:40.116
Kind of an easy sell to
the Chief because you're white.

00:18:40.458 --> 00:18:43.698
See? There's that, there's
that thing that I was saying.

00:18:53.798 --> 00:18:56.007
Are we for sure in the clear?
How's Meg?

00:18:56.934 --> 00:18:58.518
Mom, have you seen Meg?

00:18:58.594 --> 00:18:59.852
Yeah, she went to the store.

00:18:59.929 --> 00:19:01.069
Well, I'm sure she's fine.

00:19:01.094 --> 00:19:02.311
To pick up some ointment.

00:19:02.975 --> 00:19:04.265
For her vagina.

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:08.236
Oh, bit of a journey,
but we got there.

00:19:08.331 --> 00:19:10.182
Listen, Stewie,
we never should've used

00:19:10.292 --> 00:19:11.791
