without telling you.

00:19:11.996 --> 00:19:13.816
Chris and I owe you an apology.

00:19:13.893 --> 00:19:15.059
It's fine, Brian.

00:19:15.213 --> 00:19:17.003
At least your heart was
in the right place.

00:19:17.303 --> 00:19:20.898
Yeah, well, that's the thing.
I'm... I'm not sure it was.

00:19:21.226 --> 00:19:23.492
You see, Chris,
I never should've suggested

00:19:23.522 --> 00:19:25.188
