00:19:25.213 --> 00:19:26.754
What? Why not?

00:19:27.185 --> 00:19:29.665
Well, I realize now
that all the awkward,

00:19:29.743 --> 00:19:32.668
embarrassing, difficult
experiences in life are exactly

00:19:32.746 --> 00:19:35.004
