back in its holster.

00:19:45.858 --> 00:19:47.933
Eh, that could just be
time-travel-related.

00:19:48.011 --> 00:19:50.119
-From the reentry.
-R-Really?

00:19:50.196 --> 00:19:52.789
Yeah, you know how you can get
rando boners on airplanes?

00:19:52.865 --> 00:19:54.698
-It's like that.
-Oh, that's right.

00:19:54.775 --> 00:19:56.367
The first person
it ever happened to

00:19:56.443 --> 00:19:57.701
