 around his waist.

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.636
I am perfectly limp,

00:20:08.865 --> 00:20:11.307
and what the Nazis do is
 an internal matter.

00:20:17.373 --> 00:20:18.815
What's going on, guys?

00:20:18.817 --> 00:20:21.245
It's me, Corey,
with After the "Guy."

00:20:21.394 --> 00:20:22.743
We've only got a minute
to break down

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.837
all the best guy moments
from this week.

00:20:25.138 --> 00:20:28.566
And, as always, we're brought
to you by too many sponsors.

00:20:28.568 --> 00:20:30.751
Peter, what did you think
of the episode?

00:20:30.828 --> 00:20:33.179
Well, Corey, I'd say most of it
was freaking sweet,

00:20:33.256 --> 00:20:35.330
just like squeezable
Smucker's jelly,

00:20:35.408 --> 00:20:36.569
now with a spillproof top.

00:20:36.686 --> 00:20:38.576
And even if there was
a plot hole or two,

00:20:38.578 --> 00:20:40.002
