three years later.

00:20:44.308 --> 00:20:47.752
Okay, question for Stewie.
"Who can understand the baby?"

00:20:47.891 --> 00:20:50.860
Okay, as I've explained for
the last six of these, Corey--

00:20:51.191 --> 00:20:53.793
He-he had to leave.
He's boxing Jake Paul tonight.

00:20:54.078 --> 00:20:56.487
Closing credits
 under theme song.

